.TH "mindyourhead-by-macslow" "6" "2025-02-08" "Mind your head User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
mindyourhead-by-macslow - run the Mind your head 4k intro by MacSlow
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
mindyourhead-by-macslow [\f[I]\[en]help\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Mind your head is a 4k intro for Linux 64-bit by MacSlow, using SDL 2
and OpenGL 4.
It was released at Revision 2019 (PC 4k intro compo, 13th place).
.PP
The intro runs fullscreen at 1920x1080 and has no sound.
It quits by itself after about 90 seconds.
A dedicated GPU is recommended.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
--help
Display help for the command
.SH KEYS
.TP
Escape
Quit the intro
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
__GL_SYNC_TO_VBLANK
Set to 1 by default by the launcher to enable V-Sync with the NVIDIA
proprietary driver, as the intro does not request it itself.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://www.pouet.net/prod.php?which=81157
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
